ed: items not reported there are left out.","Diluted EPS by quarter as reported in the 10-Qs; fourth quarters are calculated (net income ÷ estimated diluted shares) because EPS does not add across quarters.","Percentages are of revenue; figures may not sum due to rounding."],"report":{"summary":["Farmers & Merchants Bancorp is the holding company for The Farmers & Merchants State Bank, which provides banking services to individuals and businesses. Revenue (net interest income plus noninterest income) rose 19.7% to $121M in 2025. Net interest income rose 21.4% to $104M and noninterest income rose 10.5% to $17.2M; noninterest expense rose 12.0%, and the provision for credit losses was $2.1M, versus $273K.","Net income to common rose 29.4% to $32.9M, or $2.43 per diluted share, and the efficiency ratio was 63.3% versus 67.6%. Farmers & Merchants Bancorp returned $12.4M through dividends and buybacks."],"highlights":["Revenue rose 19.7% to $121M.","Net interest income rose 21.4%.","Noninterest income rose 10.5% to $17.2M.","Net income to common rose 29.4% to $32.9M."],"watch":["Credit-loss provision rose 7.7× to $2.1M.","Net interest income depends on interest rates.","Noninterest expense was $76.9M, up 12.0%.","Credit-loss provision was $2.1M."],"table":[["Total revenue",0.1215,0.1015,1],["Net interest income",0.1043,0.0859],["Noninterest income",0.0172,0.0156],["Noninterest expense",0.0769,0.0686],["Provision for credit losses",0.0021,0.0003],["Pre-tax income",0.0425,0.0326,1],["Income tax",0.0092,0.0066],["Preferred dividends & other",-0.0004,0.0005],["Net income to common",0.0329,0.0254,1],["Diluted EPS ($)",2.426423,1.895335,0,"eps"],["Book value per share ($)",27.302575,24.754616,0,"eps"]],"sources":[["Farmers & Merchants Bancorp, Inc. Form 10-K filings (SEC EDGAR)","https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0000792966&type=10-K"],["Farmers & Merchants Bancorp financial statements (StockAnalysis)","https://stockanalysis.com/stocks/fmao/financi